# =============================================================================
# Eggshell-Diagnostic-Research — repository .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# Principle: evidence is committed, regenerable bulk is not.
#
# Committed:     results/, data/processed/*.csv, data/annotations/, notebooks,
#                source, the evaluation pack, figures and tables for Chapter 5.
# Not committed: raw and cropped images, decoded caches, model weights, secrets,
#                deployment state.
# =============================================================================


# --- Data: large, not redistributed ------------------------------------------
Artefact/data/images/
Artefact/data/raw/
Artefact/data/interim/

# Decoded image caches written by notebook 02.
# These are ~393 MB EACH and exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard per-file limit: a push
# containing them is rejected outright, and once committed they remain in history
# even after deletion. They are fully regenerable by re-running notebook 02.
Artefact/data/processed/*.npy
Artefact/data/processed/*.npz
Artefact/data/processed/*.memmap
Artefact/data/processed/cache_*

# The small derived tables ARE evidence and must be kept. Negations must come
# after the patterns above or they have no effect.
!Artefact/data/processed/*.csv
!Artefact/data/processed/*.json


# --- Model weights: regenerable, too large -----------------------------------
# For AWS, ship these via S3 or a GitHub release asset, not through git.
Artefact/models/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.tflite


# --- Secrets: never commit ---------------------------------------------------
# Streamlit reads secrets.toml automatically; committing it leaks whatever is in
# it. The example file is committed so the required keys are documented.
.streamlit/secrets.toml
**/.streamlit/secrets.toml
!**/.streamlit/secrets.toml.example
!**/.streamlit/config.toml

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials
credentials.json
aws_credentials
.aws/
*_rsa
*_rsa.pub
id_ed25519*


# --- AWS and deployment state ------------------------------------------------
# Terraform state can contain secrets in plain text and must never be committed.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
crash.log

# CDK / SAM / Serverless / Elastic Beanstalk
cdk.out/
.aws-sam/
samconfig.toml
.serverless/
.elasticbeanstalk/*
!.elasticbeanstalk/*.cfg.yml
!.elasticbeanstalk/*.global.yml

# Docker build context leftovers
.dockerignore.local
docker-compose.override.yml

# Deployment bundles
deploy/*.zip
deploy/build/
*.tar.gz
!Templates/**/*.tar.gz


# --- Transfer archives -------------------------------------------------------
eggshell_outputs*.zip
Artefact/results/**/*.zip


# --- Python / Jupyter --------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*


# --- Editors and operating systems -------------------------------------------
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json.example
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# OneDrive conflict copies. The repository lives under OneDrive on the work
# machine, which silently creates these when a file is open on two devices.
*-Conflict.*
*(conflicted copy*
* - Copy.*


# --- Large binaries that occasionally appear ---------------------------------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.psd
*.sqlite
*.db

# The CI/CD pipeline builds the Docker image on a GitHub-hosted runner, which only sees what is
# committed. The three final checkpoints (~15 MB each) and the rule-base CSV therefore have to be
# in the repository. Everything else under models/ and data/processed/ stays ignored.
#
# Order matters: a directory must be un-ignored before files inside it can be.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Artefact/models/*
!Artefact/models/final/
Artefact/models/final/*
!Artefact/models/final/final_efficientnet_b0_multitask_seg_seed*.pt

Artefact/data/processed/*
!Artefact/data/processed/root_cause_rules_recovered.csv


# =============================================================================
# Deliberately NOT ignored — these are the evidence for Chapter 5
# =============================================================================
# Artefact/results/                  figures, tables, digests, runs.csv
# Artefact/data/processed/*.csv      master_table, splits, post_stats, coverage
# Artefact/data/annotations/         labels, annotation guideline, rule evidence
# Artefact/data/metadata/            mapping, crop_log, review_log
# Artefact/notebooks/                all notebooks, outputs cleared before commit
# Artefact/src/, app/, tests/        source, dashboard, functional tests
# Artefact/evaluation_pack/          consent, UAT script, SUS instrument
#
# master_table.csv and splits.csv reference images by file name only, so they
# remain portable between machines without the image folder.
# =============================================================================